    stg:description "Fragment composed of three joining pieces from the bowl of a kylix.  On the exterior, to the left is a trace of the kylix handle root with a relief line marking off the reserve area between the handles. Interior:  meander to the left; exterior (Side A):  under handle root of left handle, leg of a stool; lower part of a male figure wearing a himation, leaning of a staff. Relief contours, preliminary sketch, dilute glaze musculature. Shoe on right foot of figure facing right." ;
